00:01:52.980 --> 00:01:57.284 size:53% position:73% line:53%
L'augmentation du niveau de

00:01:54.515 --> 00:01:59.787 size:53% position:73% line:53%
la mer, entre parenthèses,

00:01:56.049 --> 00:02:01.288 size:53% position:73% line:53%
