00:02:30.484 --> 00:02:36.056 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Donc, le changement de

00:02:31.718 --> 00:02:37.591 size:53% position:73% line:53%
la température de l'eau,

00:02:34.821 --> 00:02:39.093 size:53% position:73% line:53%
